:185:    description: \"Spawn fan-out lineages; skip and proceed to phase_init normally when single-executor\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:190:      This step runs before phase_init, so pass the raw review_focus. fanout-run.cjs\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:199:      deep/review command surface with config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir so the LEAF\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:202:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:225:  phase_init:\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:371:          open_run: \"Run step_create_state_log.command unchanged. With the hand-written log set aside, it opens the run from the moved config.\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:526:      step_create_state_log:\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:1966:        skip_when: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is present\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-ai-council-auto.yaml:31:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-review.contract.markdown:227:| `config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir` | N | internal flag `--fanout-lineage-artifact-dir=PATH` or marker `config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir` | none | N |\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-review.contract.markdown:280:   |-- --fanout-lineage-artifact-dir=PATH -> config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir = PATH (internal single-lineage command invocation only)\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-review.contract.markdown:396:- `config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir` when present\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-review.contract.markdown:423:  - \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:54:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:147:  # step_resolve_artifact_root plus the shared resolver, so root specs keep root-local\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:179:  step_resolve_artifact_root:\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:182:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:185:        artifact_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:186:        artifact_root_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:188:        artifact_archive_root: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}/_archive\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:199:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"compiled\ndeep-ai-council-auto.yaml\ndeep-ai-council-confirm.yaml\ndeep-ai-council-presentation.txt\ndeep-research-auto.yaml\ndeep-research-confirm.yaml\ndeep-research-presentation.txt\ndeep-review-auto.yaml\ndeep-review-confirm.yaml\ndeep-review-presentation.txt\nlegacy\n---\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-ai-council-confirm.yaml:31:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:45:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:125:  # step_resolve_artifact_root plus the shared resolver, so root specs keep\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:156:  step_resolve_artifact_root:\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:159:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:162:        artifact_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:163:        artifact_root_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:165:        artifact_archive_root: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}/_archive\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:176:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:185:    description: \"Spawn fan-out lineages; skip and proceed to phase_init normally when single-executor\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:190:      This step runs before phase_init, so pass the raw review_focus. fanout-run.cjs\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:199:      deep/review command surface with config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir so the LEAF\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:202:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:225:  phase_init:\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:371:          open_run: \"Run step_create_state_log.command unchanged. With the hand-written log set aside, it opens the run from the moved config.\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:526:      step_create_state_log:\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:1966:        skip_when: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is present\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-ai-council-auto.yaml:31:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-review.contract.markdown:227:| `config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir` | N | internal flag `--fanout-lineage-artifact-dir=PATH` or marker `config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir` | none | N |\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-review.contract.markdown:280:   |-- --fanout-lineage-artifact-dir=PATH -> config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir = PATH (internal single-lineage command invocation only)\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-review.contract.markdown:396:- `config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir` when present\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-review.contract.markdown:423:  - \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:54:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:147:  # step_resolve_artifact_root plus the shared resolver, so root specs keep root-local\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:179:  step_resolve_artifact_root:\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:182:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:185:        artifact_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:186:        artifact_root_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:188:        artifact_archive_root: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}/_archive\"\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:199:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"ls .skilled/commands/deep/assets/ 2>&1; echo \\\"---\\\"; grep -n \\\"step_create_state_log\\\\|step_reduce_state\\\\|fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\\\\|phase_init\\\\|step_resolve_artifact_root\\\" -r .skilled/commands/deep/assets/ 2>/dev/null | head -30\"}"},"time":{"start":1793915927891,"end":1793915928225}}}}
