{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793916007699,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"partID":"prt_1adb9f39c002hXv22v6SABmbO5","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adb9e863001yslUnhRwYfFgOS","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-93a5660b77784ae5","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/617b2600-a71c-4154-80bb-9def2171203a/scratchpad/src/dsh-src\ngrep -n \"dsh-headless\\|Answer one task and exit\\|--json  \\|--session-id <id>\\|--permission-mode <preset>\\|--approval-policy\\|--add-dir\" docs/cli-help.md | head -20; echo \"===AGENT MODEL===\"; grep -rn \"agentDefaultModel\" packages/core/agent-default-model/README.md | head -10"},"output":"15:- [`dsh headless`](#dsh-headless)\n100:<a id=\"dsh-headless\"></a>\n108:Answer one task and exit; the answer goes to stdout and diagnostics to stderr.\n115:  --json                      write newline-delimited run events to stdout\n117:  --session-id <id>           adopt the persisted Session with this id; an\n119:  --permission-mode <preset>  select a configured permission preset for this\n121:  --approval-policy <policy>  set approval behavior after selecting the\n123:  --add-dir <path>            allow an additional physical absolute directory\n132:  dsh --profile headless --permission-mode workspace-write --add-dir /repo/.git \"commit the fix\"\n===AGENT MODEL===\npackages/core/agent-default-model/README.md:53:const selection = ctx.agentDefaultModel.currentSelection()\npackages/core/agent-default-model/README.md:54:await ctx.agentDefaultModel.saveSelection({ provider, model, reasoningEffort: 'high' })\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"15:- [`dsh headless`](#dsh-headless)\n100:<a id=\"dsh-headless\"></a>\n108:Answer one task and exit; the answer goes to stdout and diagnostics to stderr.\n115:  --json                      write newline-delimited run events to stdout\n117:  --session-id <id>           adopt the persisted Session with this id; an\n119:  --permission-mode <preset>  select a configured permission preset for this\n121:  --approval-policy <policy>  set approval behavior after selecting the\n123:  --add-dir <path>            allow an additional physical absolute directory\n132:  dsh --profile headless --permission-mode workspace-write --add-dir /repo/.git \"commit the fix\"\n===AGENT MODEL===\npackages/core/agent-default-model/README.md:53:const selection = ctx.agentDefaultModel.currentSelection()\npackages/core/agent-default-model/README.md:54:await ctx.agentDefaultModel.saveSelection({ provider, model, reasoningEffort: 'high' })\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/617b2600-a71c-4154-80bb-9def2171203a/scratchpad/src/dsh-src\\ngrep -n \\\"dsh-headless\\\\|Answer one task and exit\\\\|--json  \\\\|--session-id <id>\\\\|--permission-mode <preset>\\\\|--approval-policy\\\\|--add-dir\\\" docs/cli-help.md | head -20; echo \\\"===AGENT MODEL===\\\"; grep -rn \\\"agentDefaultModel\\\" packages/core/agent-default-model/README.md | head -10\"}"},"time":{"start":1793916007324,"end":1793916007699}}}}
