{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793916086881,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"partID":"prt_1adbb1cb5001pyAyP4Qr4Entf5","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adbb179e001YA9S2CeLJ731Cs","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-828780fb555e33e4","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.79,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 2: providers, models and reasoning\",\"findingsCount\":8,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Four findings are new (route schema, compatibility switch, default-row lever, fail-closed gap); three extend facts the resource map already recorded.\",\"answeredQuestions\":[\"How are providers, models and reasoning levels configured, and can LLM Gateway and OpenCode Go be added as closed, fail-closed routes?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"A --model or --provider dispatch flag\",\"Relying on the harness catalog to enforce a model allowlist\"],\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"dsh-src/docs/user/guide/providers.md:27-166\",\"dsh-src/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md:38,123\",\"dsh-src/packages/core/agent-default-model/README.md:22-33\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:90-94\",\"dsh-src/docs/config-catalog.md:2225\",\"dsh-src/docs/cli-help.md:41-42\",\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-pi/references/providers-and-models.md:89,99\",\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-pi/hard-rules.json:28-35\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-05T22:05:10Z\",\"durationMs\":150000}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-001\",\"label\":\"A custom OpenAI-compatible route is a llm-pi-ai row with providers.<id> naming apiKeyEnv, one of three api protocols, baseURL and a non-empty models list; the provider id is permanent, lowercase and hyphenated, and one provider speaks one protocol.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/user/guide/providers.md:27-33\",\"dsh-src/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md:123\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-002\",\"label\":\"LLM Gateway is expressible as provider llmgateway, api openai-completions, baseURL https://api.llmgateway.io/v1, model deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017, with compat.supportsDeveloperRole false and the bare (not provider-prefixed) model id.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-pi/references/providers-and-models.md:89\",\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-pi/references/providers-and-models.md:99\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-003\",\"label\":\"OpenCode Go is expressible as provider opencode-go, api openai-completions, baseURL https://opencode.ai/inference/go/openai/v1, model deepseek-v4.1-flash; declaration does not imply reachability, since its 2026-11-05 smoke failed overloaded.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/resource-map.md:52-54\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-004\",\"label\":\"Reasoning levels are declared per model as reasoningEfforts mapping a level to its reasoning_effort wire spelling; max is a real level, DeepSeek's built-in route offers off/low/high/max, a hand-declared model has none until declared, and unsupported selections fail with UNSUPPORTED_REASONING_EFFORT.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/user/guide/providers.md:134-166\",\"dsh-src/docs/config-catalog.md:2225\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-005\",\"label\":\"DeepSeek V4 behind an OpenAI-compatible gateway needs compat.thinkingFormat deepseek so off sends thinking disabled and other levels send thinking enabled beside the effort.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/user/guide/providers.md:155-166\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-006\",\"label\":\"apiKeyEnv is a credential reference resolved per request, keeping secrets out of config; failures carry stable codes MISSING_CREDENTIAL, INVALID_CREDENTIAL, UNKNOWN_MODEL, QUOTA and RATE_LIMIT.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md:38\",\"dsh-src/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md:123\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-007\",\"label\":\"The shipped default route is agent-default-model with provider deepseek-official and model deepseek-flash; a --patch overlay can replace that row with provider, model and reasoningEffort, which is the per-dispatch route lever a --model flag would have provided.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:90-94\",\"dsh-src/packages/core/agent-default-model/README.md:22-33\",\"dsh-src/docs/cli-help.md:41-42\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-008\",\"label\":\"Fail-closed enforcement is only partly native: the adapter refuses an unconfigured model id but agent-default-model does not validate catalog membership, so a closed roster needs the skill packet and dispatch preflight guard to pin provider and model.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/core/agent-default-model/README.md:33\",\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-pi/hard-rules.json:28-35\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A --model or --provider dispatch flag on dsh headless\",\"reason\":\"The installed help exposes no model or provider option; selection is profile config.\",\"iteration\":2}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Relying on the harness to enforce a model allowlist\",\"reason\":\"Only profile-declared routes are validated, and agent-default-model does not check catalog membership.\",\"iteration\":2}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-002.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.79,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 2: providers, models and reasoning\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":8,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Four findings are new (route schema, compatibility switch, default-row lever, fail-closed gap); three extend facts the resource map already recorded.\\\",\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"How are providers, models and reasoning levels configured, and can LLM Gateway and OpenCode Go be added as closed, fail-closed routes?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"A --model or --provider dispatch flag\\\",\\\"Relying on the harness catalog to enforce a model allowlist\\\"],\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/docs/user/guide/providers.md:27-166\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md:38,123\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/core/agent-default-model/README.md:22-33\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.