forts mapping a level to its reasoning_effort wire spelling; max is a real level, DeepSeek's built-in route offers off/low/high/max, a hand-declared model has none until declared, and unsupported selections fail with UNSUPPORTED_REASONING_EFFORT.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/docs/user/guide/providers.md:134-166\\\",\\\"dsh-src/docs/config-catalog.md:2225\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"DeepSeek V4 behind an OpenAI-compatible gateway needs compat.thinkingFormat deepseek so off sends thinking disabled and other levels send thinking enabled beside the effort.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/docs/user/guide/providers.md:155-166\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"apiKeyEnv is a credential reference resolved per request, keeping secrets out of config; failures carry stable codes MISSING_CREDENTIAL, INVALID_CREDENTIAL, UNKNOWN_MODEL, QUOTA and RATE_LIMIT.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md:38\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md:123\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The shipped default route is agent-default-model with provider deepseek-official and model deepseek-flash; a --patch overlay can replace that row with provider, model and reasoningEffort, which is the per-dispatch route lever a --model flag would have provided.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:90-94\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/core/agent-default-model/README.md:22-33\\\",\\\"dsh-src/docs/cli-help.md:41-42\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Fail-closed enforcement is only partly native: the adapter refuses an unconfigured model id but agent-default-model does not validate catalog membership, so a closed roster needs the skill packet and dispatch preflight guard to pin provider and model.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/core/agent-default-model/README.md:33\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-pi/hard-rules.json:28-35\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"A --model or --provider dispatch flag on dsh headless\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The installed help exposes no model or provider option; selection is profile config.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Relying on the harness to enforce a model allowlist\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Only profile-declared routes are validated, and agent-default-model does not check catalog membership.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-002.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1793916083381,"end":1793916086881}}}}
