{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793916135999,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"partID":"prt_1adbbcfad001b3qWYAGwo0UtdX","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adbbc975001j3wLMQapH8ISCW","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9871b405acef0854","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.86,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 3: profiles, DSH_HOME and repo-local configuration\",\"findingsCount\":8,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Five findings are new (project instruction chain, profile file list, no project config, patch overlay grammar, repo folder split); two extend known DSH_HOME and --patch facts.\",\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What does the harness read from the working directory and `$DSH_HOME`, and what should a repo-local runtime folder contain?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"A repo-local profile directory\",\"A .dsh/settings.json analogue\"],\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"dsh-src/packages/util/home-paths/README.md:34-52\",\"dsh-src/packages/boot/app-boot/README.md:52\",\"dsh-src/packages/context/agent-instructions/README.md:30-76\",\"dsh-src/packages/settings/settings/README.md:12-24\",\"dsh-src/docs/cli-help.md:41-42\",\"dsh-src/apps/cli/config/examples/ptc.yml\",\"AGENTS.md:1\",\".pi/SYNC.md:18-40\",\".hermes/SYNC.md:20-40\",\"lineage-local .dsh-home profile\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-05T22:08:20Z\",\"durationMs\":190000}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"label\":\"The harness home resolves explicit config, then DSH_HOME, then ~/.dsh, treating a blank DSH_HOME as unset; the shared agents home resolves from DSH_AGENTS_HOME or ~/.agents and sits deliberately outside the harness home.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/util/home-paths/README.md:34-52\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"label\":\"A profile is $DSH_HOME/profiles/<name> with cordis.yml, cordis.patch.yml, package.json and pnpm-workspace.yaml plus shared profiles/node_modules; there is no project-level profile lookup, so a checkout cannot carry a profile.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/boot/app-boot/README.md:52\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/.dsh-home/profiles/headless/cordis.patch.yml\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"label\":\"Workspace instructions are the native project read: $DSH_HOME/AGENTS.md, then <agentsHome>/AGENTS.md, then every project candidate from the .git root to the cwd, with AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md base candidates and AGENTS.local.md/CLAUDE.local.md local overlays, deduplicated by content.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/context/agent-instructions/README.md:34-38\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"label\":\"Each instruction chain gets its own maxBytes budget, 65,536 bytes in dsh-base, dropping broader files before truncating the most specific; loading refreshes on cwd change and first-party read/write/edit touches, never on shell navigation.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/context/agent-instructions/README.md:30-40\",\"dsh-src/packages/context/agent-instructions/README.md:74-76\",\"AGENTS.md:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"label\":\"--patch <path> is the only repo-local configuration lever: a repeatable overlay applied after the profile layer with the same id/disabled/config row grammar, able to replace the default-model row, enable a route or disable a plugin per dispatch.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/cli-help.md:41-42\",\"dsh-src/apps/cli/config/examples/ptc.yml\",\"dsh-src/apps/cli/config/examples/team-mode.yml\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-006\",\"label\":\"DSH_HOME can be relocated per lineage; pointing it at a lineage subdirectory produced a self-contained headless profile, session tree and storages with no dependency on ~/.dsh, which is the fan-out state-isolation mechanism and the reason the repo folder must not itself be DSH_HOME.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/.dsh-home/profiles/headless/cordis.yml\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-007\",\"label\":\"A .dsh/ repo folder has a smaller configuration surface than .pi/ or .hermes/: patches/ for overlays, SYNC.md, generated skills/agents/prompts trees, and a hand-authored plugins/ bridge, with no settings.json analogue because defaults are an agent-default-model row and settings persist into the active profile patch.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/settings/settings/README.md:12-24\",\".pi/settings.json:1-40\",\".hermes/SYNC.md:20-40\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-008\",\"label\":\"The Pi precedent splits generated from authored where the runtime forces it: agents and prompts generated, skills a whole-directory symlink, extensions hand-authored, settings/models/mcp hand-authored; Hermes generates markdown-only skill copies because its scanner quarantines symlinked trees.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".pi/SYNC.md:18-40\",\".hermes/SYNC.md:20-40\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A repo-local dsh profile directory\",\"reason\":\"Profile lookup is DSH_HOME-only and a checked-in profile would need node_modules and a package install per checkout.\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A .dsh/settings.json analogue of .pi/settings.json\",\"reason\":\"Settings persist through the active profile Cordis patch; defaults are an agent-default-model row.\",\"iteration\":3}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.86,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 3: profiles, DSH_HOME and repo-local configuration\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":8,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Five findings are new (project instruction chain, profile file list, no project config, patch overlay grammar, repo folder split); two extend known DSH_HOME and --patch facts.\\\",\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"What does the harness read from the working directory and `$DSH_HOME`, and what should a repo-local runtime folder contain?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"A repo-local profile directory\\\",\\\"A .dsh/settings.json analogue\\\"],\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/util/home-paths/README.md:34-52\\\",\\\"dsh-