{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793916195658,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"partID":"prt_1adbcc283001QxDDa0ih01AFSJ","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adbcbba30014MF4oPsEsxa8AH","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8890650813e9b9e","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.93,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 4: skills\",\"findingsCount\":8,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Six findings are new evidence on discovery depth, roots, frontmatter and limits; two extend the repo's Pi/Hermes mirror precedent into a dsh-specific decision.\",\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What skill format does the harness load, and should this repo use generated copies or symlinks?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Whole-directory symlink .dsh/skills -> .skilled/skills\",\"Markdown-only generated copies\",\"Editing 57 canonical SKILL.md files to add optional keys\"],\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:36-147\",\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/src/index.ts:811-850\",\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill/src/index.ts:21-84\",\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill/README.md:140\",\"dsh-src/packages/skill/tool-skill/README.md:48\",\".pi/SYNC.md:32-34\",\".hermes/SYNC.md:20-26\",\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/SKILL.md:1\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-05T22:11:40Z\",\"durationMs\":200000}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"label\":\"Skill discovery is exactly one level deep: a skill is <root>/<name>/SKILL.md or <root>/<name>.md, and nested **/SKILL.md files are deliberately not discovered.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:36\",\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:147\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"label\":\".skilled/skills holds 16 top-level hub directories but 57 SKILL.md files, so a whole-tree symlink at .dsh/skills would surface only the 16 hubs and hide 41 nested mode packets.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/SKILL.md:1\",\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-pi/SKILL.md:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-003\",\"label\":\"Skill roots are ranked: project .dsh/skills 100, project .agents/skills 200, customSkillDirs 300, $DSH_HOME/skills 400, $DSH_AGENTS_HOME/skills 500, bundled 600; the project root is the nearest ancestor containing .git, else the cwd.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:46-56\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-004\",\"label\":\"Frontmatter requires a kebab-case name and a description; optional keys are whenToUse, metadata, disable-model-invocation and user-invocable, and the parser ignores this repo's extra trigger_phrases, importance_tier, contextType, allowed-tools and version fields rather than rejecting them.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:36\",\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/src/index.ts:811-850\",\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill/src/index.ts:21-36\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-005\",\"label\":\"There is no content scanner, quarantine or skill size limit; invalid files are skipped with a warning, failed roots are omitted and retried, bodies load on demand, and catalog descriptions are capped at 500 characters by default.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:85\",\"dsh-src/packages/skill/tool-skill/README.md:48\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-006\",\"label\":\"Symlinked skill directories are explicitly supported and keep their resolved instruction path as the resource base, so a per-skill symlink farm preserves each packet's references, scripts and assets.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:40\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-007\",\"label\":\"Duplicate skill names resolve by layer, then root rank, then provider order, with the loser hidden and logged, so project-root .dsh/skills at rank 100 shadows same-named user skills.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill/src/index.ts:84\",\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill/README.md:140\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-008\",\"label\":\"The smallest correct move is a generated per-skill symlink farm of all 57 canonical skill directories, not a whole-tree symlink and not a markdown-only copy tree, because dsh has no scanner and Pi's whole-directory link would lose 41 skills here.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".hermes/SYNC.md:20-26\",\".pi/SYNC.md:32-34\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Whole-directory symlink .dsh/skills -> .skilled/skills\",\"reason\":\"One-level discovery would expose only the 16 hub skills and hide 41 nested mode packets.\",\"iteration\":4}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Markdown-only generated skill copies\",\"reason\":\"Copies would lose references, assets and scripts unless every body carried a canonical pointer, and dsh has no scanner reason to avoid links.\",\"iteration\":4}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.93,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 4: skills\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":8,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Six findings are new evidence on discovery depth, roots, frontmatter and limits; two extend the repo's Pi/Hermes mirror precedent into a dsh-specific decision.\\\",\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"What skill format does the harness load, and should this repo use generated copies or symlinks?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Whole-directory symlink .dsh/skills -> .skilled/skills\\\",\\\"Markdown-only generated copies\\\",\\\"Editing 57 canonical SKILL.md files to add optional keys\\\"],\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:36-147\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/src/index.ts:811-850\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill/src/index.ts:21-84\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill/README.md:140\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/tool-skill/README.md:48\\\",\\\".pi/SYNC.md:32-34\\\",\\\".hermes/SYNC.md:20-26\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/SKILL.md:1\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-05T22:11:40Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":200000}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Skill discovery is exactly one level deep: a skill is <root>/<name>/SKILL.md or <root>/<name>.md, and nested **/SKILL.md files are deliberately not discovered.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:36\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:147\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\".skilled/skills holds 16 top-level hub directories but 57 SKILL.md files, so a whole-tree symlink at .dsh/skills would surface only the 16 hubs and hide 41 nested mode packets.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/SKILL.md:1\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-pi/SKILL.md:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Skill roots are ranked: project .dsh/skills 100, project .agents/skills 200, customSkillDirs 300, $DSH_HOME/skills 400, $DSH_AGENTS_HOME/skills 500, bundled 600; the project root is the nearest ancestor containing .git, else the cwd.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:46-56\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Frontmatter requires a kebab-case name and a description; optional keys are whenToUse, metadata, disable-model-invocation and user-invocable, and the parser ignores this repo's extra trigger_phrases, importance_tier, contextType, allowed-tools and version fields rather than rejecting them.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:36\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/src/index.ts:811-850\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill/src/index.ts:21-36\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"There is no content scanner, quarantine or skill size limit; invalid files are skipped with a warning, failed roots are omitted and retried, bodies load on demand, and catalog descriptions are capped at 500 characters by default.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:85\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/tool-skill/README.md:48\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Symlinked skill directories are explicitly supported and keep their resolved instruction path as the resource base, so a per-skill symlink farm preserves each packet's references, scripts and assets.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill-filesystem/README.md:40\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Duplicate skill names resolve by layer, then root rank, then provider order, with the loser hidden and logged, so project-root .dsh/skills at rank 100 shadows same-named user skills.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill/src/index.ts:84\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/skill/skill/README.md:140\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The smallest correct move is a generated per-skill symlink farm of all 57 canonical skill directories, not a whole-tree symlink and not a markdown-only copy tree, because dsh has no scanner and Pi's whole-directory link would lose 41 skills here.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".hermes/SYNC.md:20-26\\\",\\\".pi/SYNC.md:32-34\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Whole-directory symlink .dsh/skills -> .skilled/skills\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"One-level discovery would expose only the 16 hub skills and hide 41 nested mode packets.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Markdown-only generated skill copies\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Copies would lose references, assets and scripts unless every body carried a canonical pointer, and dsh has no scanner reason to avoid links.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1793916191363,"end":1793916195658}}}}
