{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793916250479,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"partID":"prt_1adbd9004002lJW5s2lc6xPGbn","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adbd846f001c3YAdkGGT1HBS6","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-ba7de624dd3ae40e","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":5,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.90,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 5: agents, subagents, commands and goal\",\"findingsCount\":9,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Seven findings are new (mount inventory, persona lever, preset scope, subagent schema, command plane, goal semantics, plan-mode risk); two reframe known Pi/Hermes precedent as missing harness features.\",\"answeredQuestions\":[\"How can this repo's agents, subagents, commands and goal binding be reached by the harness?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"An agent-file loader or --agent flag\",\"Native slash commands from .skilled/commands/**\",\"Plan mode as an unattended gate\"],\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:315-453,521-526\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/cordis.patch.yml:9-46\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/web-app/cordis.patch.yml:598-599\",\"dsh-src/packages/preset/agent-preset-registry/README.md:26-41\",\"dsh-src/packages/subagent/tool-subagent/README.md:47-53\",\"dsh-src/docs/tool-catalog.md:2064-2110\",\"dsh-src/packages/goal/goal/README.md:12-34\",\"dsh-src/packages/plan/plan-mode/README.md:63,93\",\".pi/SYNC.md:26-34\",\".hermes/SYNC.md:22-26\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-05T22:14:50Z\",\"durationMs\":190000}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-001\",\"label\":\"The base bundle already mounts goal, goal-round-driver, command-goal, plan-mode, tool-goal, both in-process subagent providers, subagent and control tools, the workflow engine and tool, skill-filesystem and tool-skill; headless inherits all of it and disables only HMR, credentials, authorization and deepseek-account.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:315-453\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/cordis.patch.yml:35-46\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-002\",\"label\":\"Headless agent identity is the system-prompt row's personaPrefix, shipped as a one-line coding persona and replaceable by a --patch overlay; no agent-file loader scans .skilled/agents or .dsh/agents.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/cordis.patch.yml:9-12\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:521-526\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-003\",\"label\":\"Presets are declarative agent-preset rows with id and plugins mounted beside agent-preset-registry, with a persona row per composition; definitions are plugin rows rather than scanned directories and the registry is mounted by web-app, not by base or headless.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/preset/agent-preset-registry/README.md:26-41\",\"dsh-src/packages/preset/persona/README.md:24-35\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/web-app/cordis.patch.yml:598-599\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-004\",\"label\":\"The subagent tool takes description, prompt, optional name and cwd; a child preset is selectable only through agent_preset when allowedAgentPresets is configured, and there is no persona-file argument.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/tool-catalog.md:2064-2110\",\"dsh-src/packages/subagent/tool-subagent/README.md:47-53\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-005\",\"label\":\"Human commands are plugin registrations on ctx.commands that dispatch without a model turn; there is no filesystem command loader, and headless without a command adapter cannot use /goal, so .skilled/commands must be composed into prompts by the dispatcher.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/architecture.md:155\",\"dsh-src/packages/goal/command-goal/README.md:12\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-006\",\"label\":\"The goal service keeps one goal per session with compare-and-set updates, a 256-round default cap and human-authority create/edit; nothing reads goal.md, so a packet goal needs a plugin hook or explicit instructions that call create_goal.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/goal/goal/README.md:12-34\",\"dsh-src/packages/goal/tool-goal/README.md:12-18\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-007\",\"label\":\"The goal round driver auto-continues an active goal while idle, so an unattended headless dispatch could run up to 256 extra rounds past a lineage timeout unless goals are avoided or capped low.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/goal/goal-round-driver/README.md:12-30\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-008\",\"label\":\"Plan mode is mounted in base but exit_plan_mode presents over the user-questions seam and fails closed without an interactive review; headless has no live approval channel, so plan mode must stay off in unattended dispatches.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/plan/plan-mode/README.md:63\",\"dsh-src/packages/plan/plan-mode/README.md:93\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:100\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-009\",\"label\":\"Pi and Hermes expose commands as prompt templates and agents as mirrored files or persona skills; the harness has no --prompt-template or agent flag, so those surfaces must be carried by the dispatch builder and the skill catalog.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\".pi/SYNC.md:26-34\",\".hermes/SYNC.md:22-26\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"An agent-file loader or --agent flag\",\"reason\":\"No such loader or flag exists; personas come from system-prompt, presets or the prompt body.\",\"iteration\":5}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Native slash commands from .skilled/commands/**\",\"reason\":\"The command plane is plugin-registered and headless has no command adapter.\",\"iteration\":5}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Plan mode as an unattended gate\",\"reason\":\"exit_plan_mode fails closed without an interactive review, which headless does not provide.\",\"iteration\":5}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-005.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-005.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-005.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.90,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 5: agents, subagents, commands and goal\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":9,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Seven findings are new (mount inventory, persona lever, preset scope, subagent schema, command plane, goal semantics, plan-mode risk); two reframe known Pi/Hermes precedent as missing harness features.\\\",\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"How can this repo's agents, subagents, commands and goal binding be reached by the harness?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"An agent-file loader or --agent flag\\\",\\\"Native slash commands from .skilled/commands/**\\\",\\\"Plan mode as an unattended gate\\\"],\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:315-453,521-526\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/cordis.patch.yml:9-46\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/web-app/cordis.patch.yml:598-599\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/preset/agent-preset-registry/README.md:26-41\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/subagent/tool-subagent/README.md:47-53\\\",\\\"dsh-src/docs/tool-catalog.md:2064-2110\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/goal/goal/README.md:12-34\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/plan/plan-mode/README.md:63,93\\\",\\\".pi/SYNC.md:26-34\\\",\\\".hermes/SYNC.md:22-26\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-05T22:14:50Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":190000}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The base bundle already mounts goal, goal-round-driver, command-goal, plan-mode, tool-goal, both in-process subagent providers, subagent and control tools, the workflow engine and tool, skill-filesystem and tool-skill; headless inherits all of it and disables only HMR, credentials, authorization and deepseek-account.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:315-453\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/cordis.patch.yml:35-46\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Headless agent identity is the system-prompt row's personaPrefix, shipped as a one-line coding persona and replaceable by a --patch overlay; no agent-file loader scans .skilled/agents or .dsh/agents.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/cordis.patch.yml:9-12\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:521-526\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Presets are declarative agent-preset rows with id and plugins mounted beside agent-preset-registry, with a persona row per composition; definitions are plugin rows rather than scanned directories and the registry is mounted by web-app, not by base or headless.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/preset/agent-preset-registry/README.md:26-41\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/preset/persona/README.md:24-35\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/web-app/cordis.patch.yml:598-599\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The subagent tool takes description, prompt, optional name and cwd; a child preset is selectable only through agent_preset when allowedAgentPresets is configured, and there is no persona-file argument.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/docs/tool-catalog.md:2064-2110\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/subagent/tool-subagent/README.md:47-53\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Human commands are plugin registrations on ctx.commands that dispatch without a model turn; there is no filesystem command loader, and headless without a command adapter cannot use /goal, so .skilled/commands must be composed into prompts by the dispatcher.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/docs/architecture.md:155\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/goal/command-goal/README.md:12\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The goal service keeps one goal per session with compare-and-set updates, a 256-round default cap and human-authority create/edit; nothing reads goal.md, so a packet goal needs a plugin hook or explicit instructions that call create_goal.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/goal/goal/README.md:12-34\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/goal/tool-goal/README.md:12-18\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The goal round driver auto-continues an active goal while idle, so an unattended headless dispatch could run up to 256 extra rounds past a lineage timeout unless goals are avoided or capped low.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/goal/goal-round-driver/README.md:12-30\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Plan mode is mounted in base but exit_plan_mode presents over the user-questions seam and fails closed without an interactive review; headless has no live approval channel, so plan mode must stay off in unattended dispatches.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/plan/plan-mode/README.md:63\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/plan/plan-mode/README.md:93\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:100\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-009\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Pi and Hermes expose commands as prompt templates and agents as mirrored files or persona skills; the harness has no --prompt-template or agent flag, so those surfaces must be carried by the dispatch builder and the skill catalog.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".pi/SYNC.md:26-34\\\",\\\".hermes/SYNC.md:22-26\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"An agent-file loader or --agent flag\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"No such loader or flag exists; personas come from system-prompt, presets or the prompt body.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Native slash commands from .skilled/commands/**\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The command plane is plugin-registered and headless has no command adapter.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Plan mode as an unattended gate\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"exit_plan_mode fails closed without an interactive review, which headless does not provide.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-005.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1793916243972,"end":1793916250479}}}}
