{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1793916327670,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"id":"prt_1adbed6f6001DdqzrwCR2QS26D","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adbed049001T0Zj3M3SmOdo7n","type":"step-start","snapshot":"e888aba95fe23fbda307a50b9872113e155e8f34"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793916332057,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"partID":"prt_1adbed93a0028Pw0abXaaHtyNd","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adbed049001T0Zj3M3SmOdo7n","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8f842eedc0b1ea53","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":6,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.88,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 6: plugins, hooks and guards\",\"findingsCount\":9,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Eight findings are new (plugin packaging, seam inventory, bridge gaps, matcher mismatch, repo hook inventory, per-extension verdicts, bundle sizing, cwd semantics); one reframes the Hermes bundle precedent.\",\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which lifecycle seams exist for plugins and hooks, and which Pi extensions must be ported, deferred or dropped?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Porting all eighteen Pi extensions to native plugins\",\"Mounting .claude/settings.json unchanged\",\"A project-local plugin folder\"],\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"dsh-src/docs/cordis-primer.md:9\",\"dsh-src/packages/boot/plugin-manager/README.md:31-126\",\"dsh-src/docs/event-producer-consumer.md:30-91\",\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hooks-claude-code/README.md:56-102\",\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hook-protocol/src/matcher.ts:60-68\",\"dsh-src/docs/tool-catalog.md:26-52\",\".claude/settings.json\",\".pi/extensions/README.md\",\".hermes/SYNC.md:26-40\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-05T22:18:30Z\",\"durationMs\":220000}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-001\",\"label\":\"A harness plugin is a Cordis object with optional inject and an apply(ctx) field registered as a profile row by package name; a repo-local plugin must be installed into the profile as a bundle (file:/link:), and without HMR a new or changed plugin reports restart-required.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/cordis-primer.md:9\",\"dsh-src/packages/boot/plugin-manager/README.md:31\",\"dsh-src/packages/boot/plugin-manager/README.md:46\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-002\",\"label\":\"The lifecycle seams are tools/pre-execute, tools/execute, tools/post-execute, tools/result, agent/pre-step, agent/turn-stopping, agent/created, agent/disposed, session/event, turn/start, turn/end, approval/request, fs/write-intent, fs/edit-intent, fs/delete-intent, compaction/* and commands/change.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/event-producer-consumer.md:30\",\"dsh-src/docs/event-producer-consumer.md:32-54\",\"dsh-src/docs/event-producer-consumer.md:76\",\"dsh-src/docs/event-producer-consumer.md:86-91\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-003\",\"label\":\"The shipped Claude Code hook bridge maps SessionStart, UserPromptSubmit, PreToolUse, PostToolUse, Stop, SubagentStart and SubagentStop; it does not support PreCompact or SessionEnd, leaving the compact context injector and session-end cleanup without a bridge point.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hooks-claude-code/README.md:56-70\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-004\",\"label\":\"Claude literal matchers are exact and case-sensitive, while harness tool names are lowercase, so the repo's existing Bash, Write|Edit, WebFetch, Task and AskUserQuestion matchers select nothing and a rewritten .dsh/hooks.json is required.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hook-protocol/src/matcher.ts:60-68\",\"dsh-src/docs/tool-catalog.md:26-52\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-005\",\"label\":\"The repo already carries the hook implementations: .claude/settings.json wires 9 PreToolUse, 5 PostToolUse, 3 UserPromptSubmit, 8 SessionStart, 3 Stop, 1 SessionEnd and 1 PreCompact entries over runtime-neutral Node scripts.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".claude/settings.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-006\",\"label\":\"Sixteen of the nineteen Pi extensions are bridge-served by a rewritten hook config; task-dispatch-guard needs adaptation for the subagent tool name and payload, and goal-context plus session-compact-context need a native plugin.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".pi/extensions/README.md:1\",\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hooks-claude-code/README.md:94-102\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-007\",\"label\":\"A single repo bundle is the smaller move only for the residual guards: the shipped bridge carries the bulk, so repo-guards would hold two plugins and optionally a task-dispatch adapter, one install and one SYNC entry.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".hermes/SYNC.md:26-40\",\"dsh-src/packages/boot/plugin-manager/README.md:54\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-008\",\"label\":\"Hooks run in the session directory with CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR set per run, and a relative configPath resolves from the launching directory, so the dispatch builder must pin the cwd to the repo root.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hooks-claude-code/README.md:72-80\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-009\",\"label\":\"Headless disables HMR, so plugin changes cannot hot-reload in a dispatch; a lineage installs or updates the repo bundle before its run, never mid-run.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/cordis.patch.yml:35-36\",\"dsh-src/packages/boot/plugin-manager/README.md:126\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Porting all eighteen Pi extensions to native plugins\",\"reason\":\"The scripts already exist and most hook points are served by the shipped Claude Code bridge.\",\"iteration\":6}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Mounting .claude/settings.json unchanged\",\"reason\":\"Its capitalized tool matchers never match the harness's lowercase tool names.\",\"iteration\":6}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A project-local plugin folder\",\"reason\":\"Plugin resolution is profile-package based, so a repo bundle must be installed into the profile first.\",\"iteration\":6}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.88,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 6: plugins, hooks and guards\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":9,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Eight findings are new (plugin packaging, seam inventory, bridge gaps, matcher mismatch, repo hook inventory, per-extension verdicts, bundle sizing, cwd semantics); one reframes the Hermes bundle precedent.\\\",\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"Which lifecycle seams exist for plugins and hooks, and which Pi extensions must be ported, deferred or dropped?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Porting all eighteen Pi extensions to native plugins\\\",\\\"Mounting .claude/settings.json unchanged\\\",\\\"A project-local plugin folder\\\"],\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/docs/cordis-primer.md:9\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/boot/plugin-manager/README.md:31-126\\\",\\\"dsh-src/docs/event-producer-consumer.md:30-91\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hooks-claude-code/README.md:56-102\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hook-protocol/src/matcher.ts:60-68\\\",\\\"dsh-src/docs/tool-catalog.md:26-52\\\",\\\".claude/settings.json\\\",\\\".pi/extensions/README.md\\\",\\\".hermes/SYNC.md:26-40\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-05T22:18:30Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":220000}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"A harness plugin is a Cordis object with optional inject and an apply(ctx) field registered as a profile row by package name; a repo-local plugin must be installed into the profile as a bundle (file:/link:), and without HMR a new or changed plugin reports restart-required.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/docs/cordis-primer.md:9\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/boot/plugin-manager/README.md:31\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/boot/plugin-manager/README.md:46\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The lifecycle seams are tools/pre-execute, tools/execute, tools/post-execute, tools/result, agent/pre-step, agent/turn-stopping, agent/created, agent/disposed, session/event, turn/start, turn/end, approval/request, fs/write-intent, fs/edit-intent, fs/delete-intent, compaction/* and commands/change.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/docs/event-producer-consumer.md:30\\\",\\\"dsh-src/docs/event-producer-consumer.md:32-54\\\",\\\"dsh-src/docs/event-producer-consumer.md:76\\\",\\\"dsh-src/docs/event-producer-consumer.md:86-91\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The shipped Claude Code hook bridge maps SessionStart, UserPromptSubmit, PreToolUse, PostToolUse, Stop, SubagentStart and SubagentStop; it does not support PreCompact or SessionEnd, leaving the compact context injector and session-end cleanup without a bridge point.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hooks-claude-code/README.md:56-70\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Claude literal matchers are exact and case-sensitive, while harness tool names are lowercase, so the repo's existing Bash, Write|Edit, WebFetch, Task and AskUserQuestion matchers select nothing and a rewritten .dsh/hooks.json is required.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hook-protocol/src/matcher.ts:60-68\\\",\\\"dsh-src/docs/tool-catalog.md:26-52\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The repo already carries the hook implementations: .claude/settings.json wires 9 PreToolUse, 5 PostToolUse, 3 UserPromptSubmit, 8 SessionStart, 3 Stop, 1 SessionEnd and 1 PreCompact entries over runtime-neutral Node scripts.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".claude/settings.json:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Sixteen of the nineteen Pi extensions are bridge-served by a rewritten hook config; task-dispatch-guard needs adaptation for the subagent tool name and payload, and goal-context plus session-compact-context need a native plugin.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".pi/extensions/README.md:1\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hooks-claude-code/README.md:94-102\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"A single repo bundle is the smaller move only for the residual guards: the shipped bridge carries the bulk, so repo-guards would hold two plugins and optionally a task-dispatch adapter, one install and one SYNC entry.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".hermes/SYNC.md:26-40\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/boot/plugin-manager/README.md:54\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Hooks run in the session directory with CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR set per run, and a relative configPath resolves from the launching directory, so the dispatch builder must pin the cwd to the repo root.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/experimental/hooks-claude-code/README.md:72-80\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-009\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Headless disables HMR, so plugin changes cannot hot-reload in a dispatch; a lineage installs or updates the repo bundle before its run, never mid-run.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/cordis.patch.yml:35-36\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/boot/plugin-manager/README.md:126\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Porting all eighteen Pi extensions to native plugins\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The scripts already exist and most hook points are served by the shipped Claude Code bridge.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Mounting .claude/settings.json unchanged\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Its capitalized tool matchers never match the harness's lowercase tool names.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"A project-local plugin folder\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Plugin resolution is profile-package based, so a repo bundle must be installed into the profile first.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1793916328250,"end":1793916332057}}}}
