{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793916346583,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"partID":"prt_1adbf1e98002zCgDT9MWINUOme","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adbf0dd9001Knwssa717D8vCx","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-aa998f0c1ede7a33","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/617b2600-a71c-4154-80bb-9def2171203a/scratchpad/src/dsh-src\ngrep -n \"todo\\|tool-web\\|compaction\\|user-questions\\|tool-bash\\|tool-fs\\|tool-fs-search\" packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml | head -30; echo \"===SERVICE TIER===\"; grep -rn \"serviceTier\\|service_tier\" docs/config-catalog.md packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md | head -10; echo \"===CACHE===\"; grep -rn \"supportsLongCacheRetention\\|cacheControlFormat\\|sessionAffinity\\|sendSessionAffinity\" docs/config-catalog.md packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md | head -12"},"output":"79:    - id: user-questions\n80:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-user-questions'\n281:    - id: tool-bash\n282:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-bash'\n296:    - id: tool-fs\n297:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs'\n302:    - id: tool-fs-search\n303:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs-search'\n344:              The tool catalog stays the same across modes for request-cache stability. These plan-mode rules override any later tool description or guidance that suggests using mutation tools; those tools remain listed only to keep the request shape stable. Do not use todo_write to track this planning phase: it tracks implementation after an approved plan, while the plan itself belongs in exit_plan_mode.\n355:    - id: compaction-basic\n356:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic'\n359:    # independent, so it follows whichever compaction service this leaf mounts.\n434:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-tool-result-pruner'\n443:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-image-offload'\n445:    - id: tool-todo\n446:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-todo'\n464:    # preset; products with a stricter network policy override tool-web. Search\n499:    - id: tool-web\n500:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-web'\n===SERVICE TIER===\n===CACHE===\ndocs/config-catalog.md:2194:  cacheControlFormat?: NonNullable<OpenAICompletionsCompat['cacheControlFormat']>\ndocs/config-catalog.md:2199:  supportsLongCacheRetention?: boolean\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"79:    - id: user-questions\n80:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-user-questions'\n281:    - id: tool-bash\n282:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-bash'\n296:    - id: tool-fs\n297:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs'\n302:    - id: tool-fs-search\n303:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs-search'\n344:              The tool catalog stays the same across modes for request-cache stability. These plan-mode rules override any later tool description or guidance that suggests using mutation tools; those tools remain listed only to keep the request shape stable. Do not use todo_write to track this planning phase: it tracks implementation after an approved plan, while the plan itself belongs in exit_plan_mode.\n355:    - id: compaction-basic\n356:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic'\n359:    # independent, so it follows whichever compaction service this leaf mounts.\n434:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-tool-result-pruner'\n443:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-image-offload'\n445:    - id: tool-todo\n446:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-todo'\n464:    # preset; products with a stricter network policy override tool-web. Search\n499:    - id: tool-web\n500:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-web'\n===SERVICE TIER===\n===CACHE===\ndocs/config-catalog.md:2194:  cacheControlFormat?: NonNullable<OpenAICompletionsCompat['cacheControlFormat']>\ndocs/config-catalog.md:2199:  supportsLongCacheRetention?: boolean\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/617b2600-a71c-4154-80bb-9def2171203a/scratchpad/src/dsh-src\\ngrep -n \\\"todo\\\\|tool-web\\\\|compaction\\\\|user-questions\\\\|tool-bash\\\\|tool-fs\\\\|tool-fs-search\\\" packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml | head -30; echo \\\"===SERVICE TIER===\\\"; grep -rn \\\"serviceTier\\\\|service_tier\\\" docs/config-catalog.md packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md | head -10; echo \\\"===CACHE===\\\"; grep -rn \\\"supportsLongCacheRetention\\\\|cacheControlFormat\\\\|sessionAffinity\\\\|sendSessionAffinity\\\" docs/config-catalog.md packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md | head -12\"}"},"time":{"start":1793916346008,"end":1793916346583}}}}
