{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793916377872,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"partID":"prt_1adbf8a060016Fol7u6p8qDDid","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adbf82ce001sWU7LzS46ESB8L","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-909e88540f500ffc","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":7,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.90,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 7: third-party plugin migration\",\"findingsCount\":11,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Nine findings are new per-package verdicts and two extend the plugin-market and base-mount evidence into a no-migration conclusion.\",\"answeredQuestions\":[\"For each third-party Pi plugin, does the harness ship the capability natively, offer a market equivalent, or is it irrelevant to dispatch?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Porting any Pi package as a dsh plugin\",\"Installing from the plugin market as a migration shortcut\",\"A service-tier plugin for pi-fast-mode\"],\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".pi/PLUGINS.md:16-102\",\".pi/settings.json\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:79-500\",\"dsh-src/packages/todo/tool-todo/README.md:12\",\"dsh-src/packages/team/agent-team/README.md:12\",\"dsh-src/packages/plan/plan-mode/README.md:63\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:56,100\",\"dsh-src/docs/config-catalog.md:2031-2199\",\"dsh-src/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md:150\",\"dsh-src/docs/user/guide/plugin-market.md:12\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-05T22:21:30Z\",\"durationMs\":180000}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-001\",\"label\":\"Six of the ten Pi packages have a native equivalent already mounted by dsh-base: todo_write, the user-questions seam, compaction with result pruning and image offload, subagents plus the team task board, plan mode, and web_fetch/web_search.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:79-80\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:355-359\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:434-446\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:499-500\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-002\",\"label\":\"rpiv-ask-user-question maps to the native user-questions seam, but a headless dispatch has no live answer channel, so the verdict is drop for dispatch and keep for interactive profiles.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:100\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-003\",\"label\":\"rpiv-todo is natively replaced by todo_write, which persists across turns and reopened sessions with whole-list replacement and per-session ownership.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/todo/tool-todo/README.md:12\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-004\",\"label\":\"pi-blackhole's compaction half maps to compaction-basic plus the tool-result pruner and image offload; its observational-memory half has no native store and is dropped.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:355-359\",\".pi/PLUGINS.md:30\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-005\",\"label\":\"pi-btw's parallel side conversations map to subagent/subagent_fork and the team task board, which share the checkout and keep intermediate traffic out of the parent conversation.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:363-403\",\"dsh-src/packages/team/agent-team/README.md:12\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-006\",\"label\":\"pi-cache-optimizer is replaced by route configuration: cacheControlFormat, supportsLongCacheRetention and profile headers cover prompt-cache markers and session affinity, with no plugin needed.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/config-catalog.md:2194-2199\",\"dsh-src/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md:150\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-007\",\"label\":\"pi-fast-mode has no native equivalent: the config catalog exposes no serviceTier or service_tier field on a model route, and the harness executor's serviceTier is an OpenCode-runner concept, so the verdict is not portable.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/config-catalog.md:2031-2108\",\".pi/PLUGINS.md:81\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-008\",\"label\":\"pi-plan-build maps to native plan mode for interactive profiles, but exit_plan_mode fails closed without an interactive review, so headless dispatches use a prompt-phase pattern instead.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/plan/plan-mode/README.md:63\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-009\",\"label\":\"pi-claude-code-ui and pi-statusline are rendering-only packages with no headless surface, so they are not relevant to dispatch.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".pi/PLUGINS.md:68-79\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-010\",\"label\":\"pi-web-access is partly replaced: web_fetch and web_search are native and the headless profile routes DeepSeek Search and Fetch through the model credential, while PDF extraction, YouTube and local-video analysis have no native equivalent.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:56\",\".pi/PLUGINS.md:102\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-011\",\"label\":\"The plugin market is not a Pi compatibility layer: dsh ships no index source, indexes list installable dsh bundles, and Pi packages are not dsh bundles, so the market matters only as a future distribution channel for the repo's own bundle.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/user/guide/plugin-market.md:12\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Porting any Pi package as a dsh plugin\",\"reason\":\"None is a dsh bundle and six capabilities already exist natively.\",\"iteration\":7}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Installing from the plugin market as a migration shortcut\",\"reason\":\"Pi packages are not listed as dsh bundles and dsh ships no index source.\",\"iteration\":7}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A service-tier plugin for pi-fast-mode\",\"reason\":\"No model-route request field exists to carry it.\",\"iteration\":7}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.90,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 7: third-party plugin migration\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":11,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Nine findings are new per-package verdicts and two extend the plugin-market and base-mount evidence into a no-migration conclusion.\\\",\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"For each third-party Pi plugin, does the harness ship the capability natively, offer a market equivalent, or is it irrelevant to dispatch?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Porting any Pi package as a dsh plugin\\\",\\\"Installing from the plugin market as a migration shortcut\\\",\\\"A service-tier plugin for pi-fast-mode\\\"],\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".pi/PLUGINS.md:16-102\\\",\\\".pi/settings.json\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:79-500\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/todo/tool-todo/README.md:12\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/team/agent-team/README.md:12\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/plan/plan-mode/README.md:63\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:56,100\\\",\\\"dsh-src/docs/config-catalog.md:2031-2199\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md:150\\\",\\\"dsh-src/docs/user/guide/plugin-market.md:12\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-05T22:21:30Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":180000}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Six of the ten Pi packages have a native equivalent already mounted by dsh-base: todo_write, the user-questions seam, compaction with result pruning and image offload, subagents plus the team task board, plan mode, and web_fetch/web_search.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:79-80\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:355-359\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:434-446\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:499-500\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"rpiv-ask-user-question maps to the native user-questions seam, but a headless dispatch has no live answer channel, so the verdict is drop for dispatch and keep for interactive profiles.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:100\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"rpiv-todo is natively replaced by todo_write, which persists across turns and reopened sessions with whole-list replacement and per-session ownership.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/todo/tool-todo/README.md:12\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"pi-blackhole's compaction half maps to compaction-basic plus the tool-result pruner and image offload; its observational-memory half has no native store and is dropped.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:355-359\\\",\\\".pi/PLUGINS.md:30\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"pi-btw's parallel side conversations map to subagent/subagent_fork and the team task board, which share the checkout and keep intermediate traffic out of the parent conversation.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:363-403\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/team/agent-team/README.md:12\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"pi-cache-optimizer is replaced by route configuration: cacheControlFormat, supportsLongCacheRetention and profile headers cover prompt-cache markers and session affinity, with no plugin needed.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/docs/config-catalog.md:2194-2199\\\",\\\"dsh-src/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md:150\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"pi-fast-mode has no native equivalent: the config catalog exposes no serviceTier or service_tier field on a model route, and the harness executor's serviceTier is an OpenCode-runner concept, so the verdict is not portable.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"dsh-src/docs/config-catalog.md:2031-2108\\\",\\\".pi/PLUGINS.md:81\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":