idge has a live playbook scenario. The packet is `cli-external-orchestration/071-cli-hermes-creation`.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled/.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/README.md:\n  Line 231: | `cli-hermes` | Hermes Agent | Quiet oneshot dispatch through the LLM Gateway roster, prompt on stdin |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled/.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.1.0.md:\n  Line 167: Each touched skill and mode has its own changelog entry, in cli-classifier (cli-jev), cli-external-orchestration (cli-claude-code, cli-codex, cli-cursor, cli-devin, cli-hermes, cli-opencode, cli-pi), cli-orca, mcp-code-mode, mcp-tooling (mcp-aside-devtools, mcp-chrome-devtools, mcp-click-up, mcp-figma, mcp-mobbin, mcp-notion, mcp-obsidian, mcp-refero), sk-code (sk-code-ci, sk-code-quality, sk-code-review, sk-code-skilled), sk-design (sk-design-chart, sk-design-diagram, sk-design-md-generator), sk-doc (sk-create-agent, sk-create-benchmark, sk-create-changelog, sk-create-command, sk-create-diff, sk-create-feature-catalog, sk-create-frontmatter, sk-create-goal, sk-create-quality-control, sk-create-readme, sk-create-repo-rule, sk-create-skill, sk-create-with-human-voice), sk-git, sk-prompt, system-deep-loop (deep-ai-council, deep-research, deep-review) and system-spec-kit.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled/.skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-audit.mjs:\n  Line 61:   { test: /\\bhermes\\s+chat\\b[^\\n;&|]*\\s(-q|--query|--query-file|--oneshot)\\b|\\bhermes\\b[^\\n;&|]*\\s(-z)\\b/, skill: 'cli-hermes', packetPath: 'cli-external-orchestration/cli-hermes' },\n\n  Line 94:   ['hermes', 'cli-hermes'],\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled/.skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-audit.test.mjs:\n  Line 518:       'cli-opencode', 'cli-claude-code', 'cli-codex', 'cli-devin', 'cli-cursor', 'cli-pi', 'cli-hermes',\n\n  Line 541:     expect(skillFor('hermes chat -Q --oneshot --query-file - --yolo </dev/n