de in this hub is read-only evidence — all seven orchestrate, and each mode's declared writes land in this repo's workspace. cli-cursor's native worktree/cloud-worker surfaces are opt-in escape hatches, not its default dispatch shape.\",\n12:    \"routingClass\": \"How the advisor finds the mode. For cli-external-orchestration every mode is 'metadata' = resolved by hub membership; the advisor routes the single identity cli-external-orchestration and the hub picks the mode, so no mode carries an advisor map entry or a merged-identity projection.\",\n78:        \"anthropic cli second opinion\",\n108:        \"openai cli second opinion\",\n168:        \"cognition cli second opinion\",\n178:      \"workflowMode\": \"cli-pi\",\n192:      \"packet\": \"cli-pi\",\n193:      \"packetSkillName\": \"cli-pi\",\n197:        \"pi cli\",\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled\\nls .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/stress/cli-adapter 2>/dev/null | head -20; echo \\\"---council---\\\"; ls .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/scripts | head; echo \\\"---hub---\\\"; ls .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration | head -30; echo \\\"---mode-registry hermes---\\\"; grep -n \\\"hermes\\\\|pi\\\" .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/mode-registry.json | head -10\"}"},"time":{"start":1793916616790,"end":1793916617875}}}}
