{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1793916720094,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"id":"prt_1adc4d3de001cDUtLwQbxizg7Y","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adc4c856001ryn4x6j6TV808x","type":"step-start","snapshot":"fb5a78cc3e7b00b9168343a9b74cbf37fab2a7c9"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793916736126,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"partID":"prt_1adc4d49d002qXO6C1cDZGRjC2","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adc4c856001ryn4x6j6TV808x","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a4e5f563acea7bfb","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":9,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.90,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 9: deep-loop fan-out fitness and the complete touch list\",\"findingsCount\":9,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Seven findings are new builder and isolation facts, one extends the exit-status policy, and one contributes the complete per-file consumer table.\",\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What does a deep-loop fan-out lineage builder need, and which consumers must learn the new executor kind?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"A --model or --effort flag in the builder\",\"Reusing the Pi exit-code exception\",\"Passing all DSH_* variables to the child\"],\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:11-276\",\"runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:2884-3120,3620-3730,4045-4056\",\"runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts:129-186,994-1010\",\"dsh-src/docs/cli-help.md:100-132\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:12,46,92,104\",\"dsh-src/packages/sandbox/sandbox/README.md:12,58-60,134\",\"dsh-src/packages/util/home-paths/README.md:34-40\",\"dsh-src/packages/goal/goal-round-driver/README.md:12-30\",\"dsh-src/packages/plan/plan-mode/README.md:63\",\".skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-audit.mjs:61-94\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/check-prompt-quality-card-sync.sh:69-100\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/scripts/orchestrate-session.cjs:198-381\",\"README.md:867-871\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-05T22:28:40Z\",\"durationMs\":240000}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter009-001\",\"label\":\"Registering cli-deepseek touches seven executor-config tables: EXECUTOR_KINDS, flag support, preventive sandbox capability, web-search policy, MCP capability, per-kind defaults, and the model allowlist with default and max pin.\",\"iteration\":9,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:11\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:93-122\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:140-148\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:194-209\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:251-276\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter009-002\",\"label\":\"The builder command is dsh --profile headless --json --permission-mode <mode> --approval-policy never --patch <route.yml> - with the prompt on stdin; a positional task would make the harness ignore stdin, and there is no model, effort, cwd or timeout flag.\",\"iteration\":9,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/docs/cli-help.md:100-132\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:36\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:46\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter009-003\",\"label\":\"Write permission is explicit: workspace-write confines writes to the spawn cwd plus --add-dir grants, read-only denies writes, danger-full-access bypasses the sandbox, an unusable backend fails SANDBOX_UNAVAILABLE, and --approval-policy never is the only correct unattended setting.\",\"iteration\":9,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/sandbox/sandbox/README.md:12\",\"dsh-src/packages/sandbox/sandbox/README.md:58-60\",\"dsh-src/packages/sandbox/sandbox/README.md:134\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:92\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter009-004\",\"label\":\"There is no turn or time budget in the headless contract; the runner timeout and artifact check are the only bound, so the lineage patch must also disable goal, goal-round-driver and plan-mode to prevent 256-round overruns and fail-closed plan reviews.\",\"iteration\":9,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/goal/goal-round-driver/README.md:12-30\",\"dsh-src/packages/plan/plan-mode/README.md:63\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter009-005\",\"label\":\"Per-lineage state isolation is DSH_HOME=<lineage>/.dsh-home in the child environment, which bootstraps a self-contained headless profile and session tree without reading ~/.dsh.\",\"iteration\":9,\"sources\":[\"dsh-src/packages/util/home-paths/README.md:34-40\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/.dsh-home/profiles/headless/cordis.yml\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter009-006\",\"label\":\"The dispatch-env filter is a strict allowlist of PATH, HOME, LANG, TMPDIR, NODE_PATH, TERM, USER, LOGNAME, __CF_USER_TEXT_ENCODING and LC_*, plus per-kind prefixes; cli-deepseek needs DSH_HOME as a key and LLMGATEWAY_/DEEPSEEK_ prefixes, never a blanket DSH_ prefix.\",\"iteration\":9,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts:129-186\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter009-007\",\"label\":\"The recursion guard needs SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID plus the kind in SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK; mapping the dsh binary to cli-deepseek makes a nested dsh dispatch fail closed, and dsh has no native self-invocation guard.\",\"iteration\":9,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:3700-3730\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts:994-1010\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter009-008\",\"label\":\"dsh exit status is deterministic (0 only on a completed final turn, 1 otherwise), so the runner can treat non-zero as failure but must read the --json final.reason and error event to classify provider error, denial or timeout.\",\"iteration\":9,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4045-4056\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:12\",\"dsh-src/packages/bundle/headless/README.md:104\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter009-009\",\"label\":\"The complete consumer list is 22 rows: executor-config, fanout-run, executor-audit, five unit tests, five stress-adapter files, dispatch audit and rule tests, council orchestrator and tests, three deep-mode SKILLs, six command YAMLs, three presentation files, two compiled contracts, the doctor agents-md manifest, the compiled-routing fixture and harness, eleven hub files, sibling mode tables, the advisor sync script, sk-prompt, two agents, four root docs, the trigger index, two sk-doc manifests and the fan-out feature catalog.\",\"iteration\":9,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/check-prompt-quality-card-sync.sh:69-100\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/scripts/orchestrate-session.cjs:198-381\",\".skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-audit.mjs:61-94\",\".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/mode-registry.json:5-12\",\"README.md:867-871\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A --model or --effort flag in the builder\",\"reason\":\"Headless exposes neither, so the route must be a patch and the allowlist a set of patch names.\",\"iteration\":9}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Reusing the Pi exit-code exception\",\"reason\":\"dsh exit status is deterministic; a non-zero exit is a real failure.\",\"iteration\":9}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Passing all DSH_* variables to the child\",\"reason\":\"Only DSH_HOME and DSH_PERMISSION_MODE are needed; a blanket prefix leaks unrelated knobs.\",\"iteration\":9}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-009.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-009.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-009.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":9,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1793915913100-enoz0j\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.90,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 9: deep-loop fan-out fitness and the complete touch list\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":9,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Seven findings are new builder and isolation facts, one extends the exit-status policy, and one contributes the complete per-file consumer table.\\\",\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"What does a deep-loop fan-out lineage builder need, and which consumers must learn the new executor kind?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"A --model or --effort flag in the builder\\\",\\\"Reusing the Pi exit-code exception\\\",\\\"Passing all DSH_* variables to the child\\\"],\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:11-276\\\",\\\"runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:2884-3120,3620-3730,4045-4056\\\",\\\"runtime/lib