{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793916766968,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"partID":"prt_1adc584b5001PSiVMTeguj4bF3","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adc53237001YxLoZu33BlCWbF","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a14bb6c428cc6d35","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/617b2600-a71c-4154-80bb-9def2171203a/scratchpad/src/dsh-src\ngrep -n \"telemetry\" packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml packages/bundle/headless/cordis.patch.yml | head; echo \"===ANON===\"; grep -rn \"anonymous\" packages/telemetry/*/README.md packages/*/*/README.md 2>/dev/null | head -6; echo \"===NODE-PTY===\"; grep -rn \"node-pty\\|koffi\" packages/bundle/headless/README.md packages/bundle/base/README.md packages/sandbox/sandbox-local/README.md 2>/dev/null | head -8"},"output":"packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:218:    - id: session-telemetry-otel\npackages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:219:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-session-telemetry-otel'\n===ANON===\npackages/boot/plugin-market/README.md:134:- **No credentials for APIs** — GitHub and GitLab APIs are read anonymously; private repositories always use the clone fallback, which needs the user's Git credentials for the host.\npackages/experimental/client-ui-cot-translation/README.md:74:- Google and Bing anonymous endpoints may reject requests or become unavailable; requests never fall back to another provider.\npackages/experimental/cot-translation-bundle/README.md:32:The selected service receives the expanded reasoning, which can contain private code and conversation details. Google and Bing send source text in POST request bodies. Bing and Google require no additional login or API key, but neither anonymous endpoint guarantees availability or free quotas. Eligible native `deepseek-flash` routes appear as explicit paid choices using the configured DeepSeek Account or Official API credentials. Each uncached fragment issues one independent query with thinking disabled. Reopening reuses saved results; changing provider, language, source or recipe may require another billed query. The model ID is matched without a version number, and pi-ai routes are excluded. Provider failure never sends the text to another service automatically.\npackages/experimental/translator/README.md:2:description: \"Machine translation through anonymous endpoints or optional native Flash, with reusable Session results.\"\npackages/experimental/translator/README.md:12:`ctx.translator` translates one bounded text request through Bing or Google, with optional paid native DeepSeek Flash routes. Bing remains the default; anonymous endpoints need no login or API key. Paid translation is explicitly selected and requires an existing durable Session. This experimental package is opt-in.\npackages/experimental/translator/README.md:33:| `googleEndpoint` | `https://translate.googleapis.com/translate_a/single` | Google-compatible anonymous endpoint |\n===NODE-PTY===\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:218:    - id: session-telemetry-otel\npackages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml:219:      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-session-telemetry-otel'\n===ANON===\npackages/boot/plugin-market/README.md:134:- **No credentials for APIs** — GitHub and GitLab APIs are read anonymously; private repositories always use the clone fallback, which needs the user's Git credentials for the host.\npackages/experimental/client-ui-cot-translation/README.md:74:- Google and Bing anonymous endpoints may reject requests or become unavailable; requests never fall back to another provider.\npackages/experimental/cot-translation-bundle/README.md:32:The selected service receives the expanded reasoning, which can contain private code and conversation details. Google and Bing send source text in POST request bodies. Bing and Google require no additional login or API key, but neither anonymous endpoint guarantees availability or free quotas. Eligible native `deepseek-flash` routes appear as explicit paid choices using the configured DeepSeek Account or Official API credentials. Each uncached fragment issues one independent query with thinking disabled. Reopening reuses saved results; changing provider, language, source or recipe may require another billed query. The model ID is matched without a version number, and pi-ai routes are excluded. Provider failure never sends the text to another service automatically.\npackages/experimental/translator/README.md:2:description: \"Machine translation through anonymous endpoints or optional native Flash, with reusable Session results.\"\npackages/experimental/translator/README.md:12:`ctx.translator` translates one bounded text request through Bing or Google, with optional paid native DeepSeek Flash routes. Bing remains the default; anonymous endpoints need no login or API key. Paid translation is explicitly selected and requires an existing durable Session. This experimental package is opt-in.\npackages/experimental/translator/README.md:33:| `googleEndpoint` | `https://translate.googleapis.com/translate_a/single` | Google-compatible anonymous endpoint |\n===NODE-PTY===\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/617b2600-a71c-4154-80bb-9def2171203a/scratchpad/src/dsh-src\\ngrep -n \\\"telemetry\\\" packages/bundle/base/cordis.patch.yml packages/bundle/headless/cordis.patch.yml | head; echo \\\"===ANON===\\\"; grep -rn \\\"anonymous\\\" packages/telemetry/*/README.md packages/*/*/README.md 2>/dev/null | head -6; echo \\\"===NODE-PTY===\\\"; grep -rn \\\"node-pty\\\\|koffi\\\" packages/bundle/headless/README.md packages/bundle/base/README.md packages/sandbox/sandbox-local/README.md 2>/dev/null | head -8\"}"},"time":{"start":1793916765365,"end":1793916766968}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793916768152,"sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","part":{"partID":"prt_1adc57fe7001cSHXXTn7PGtXzQ","sessionID":"ses_e52476d2effeOgPb5IbtWFIN6s","messageID":"msg_1adc53237001YxLoZu33BlCWbF","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-ae4fc2542b7307fd","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled\n/usr/bin/time -p dsh --version </dev/null 2>&1 | tail -3\necho \"---help---\"\n/usr/bin/time -p dsh headless --help </dev/null >/dev/null 2> /tmp/dsh-help-time.txt; tail -3 /tmp/dsh-help-time.txt\necho \"---node engine---\"\npython3 -c \"\nimport json\np='/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/lib/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh/package.json'\nd=json.load(open(p)); print('engines',d.get('engines')); print('deps',len(d.get('dependencies',{})))\n\""},"output":"real 0.07\nuser 0.05\nsys 0.01\n---help---\nreal 1.16\nuser 0.80\nsys 0.28\n---node engine---\nengines {'node': '>=24.9.0'}\ndeps 90\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"real 0.07\nuser 0.05\nsys 0.01\n---help---\nreal 1.16\nuser 0.80\nsys 0.28\n---node engine---\nengines {'node': '>=24.9.0'}\ndeps 90\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled\\n/usr/bin/time -p dsh --version </dev/null 2>&1 | tail -3\\necho \\\"---help---\\\"\\n/usr/bin/time -p dsh headless --help </dev/null >/dev/null 2> /tmp/dsh-help-time.txt; tail -3 /tmp/dsh-help-time.txt\\necho \\\"---node engine---\\\"\\npython3 -c \\\"\\nimport json\\np='/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/lib/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh/package.json'\\nd=json.load(open(p)); print('engines',d.get('engines')); print('deps',len(d.get('dependencies',{})))\\n\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1793916764135,"end":1793916768152}}}}
