s, a 57-entry skill-link farm loading, hook bridge installability and firing, code-mode MCP under the scrubbed env, real latency, per-run cost, and telemetry silence in FEEDBACK_ONLY.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":10,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/resource-map.md:27-32\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Treating the harness as cheaper than Pi per run\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Same gateway rate and a larger footprint; there is no harness discount.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":10}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Relying on FEEDBACK_ONLY as a telemetry hard rule\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Only DISABLED guarantees no export; FEEDBACK_ONLY still carries a configured collector URL.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":10}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Building the executor kind before the keyed contract pin\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Patch-based route selection and stdin behavior are the risks that invalidate the builder.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":10}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-010.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1793916835364,"end":1793916842451}}}}
